SHOUT - adds a statement keyword:  SHOUT "hello".

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD (SEED_KW_STATEMENT) - a seed used as a command
  - reading a string argument and printing it

Try it
  SHOUT "hello"                -> HELLO

Build it on the machine
  grow shout          # -> build/SHOUT.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as SHOUT.SED, ready to use.

